OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian in her 90s seriously   
OL,4,Ahurt in collision                      
OL,6,FA woman aged in her 90s has been taken 
OL,7,Fto hospital with serious injuries      
OL,8,Ffollowing a collision with a car.      
OL,10,FNorfolk Police said the incident       
OL,11,Finvolved a blue Peugeot 108 and a      
OL,12,Fpedestrian. The collision happened on  
OL,13,FUnthank Road near the junction with    
OL,14,FPark Lane in Norwich at about 16:20 GMT
OL,15,Fon Wednesday and the road was reopened 
OL,16,Fat 20:30.                              
OL,18,FThe East of England Ambulance Service  
OL,19,Fsaid it took one patient to the Norfolk
OL,20,Fand Norwich University Hospital for    
OL,21,Ftreatment.                             
